---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="FAQs | J-Lo's Animal Rescue">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Frequently Asked Questions</p><h1 class="section-title">A few things to know before you adopt.</h1></div></section>
<section class="content-section"><div class="container faq"><details open><summary>How do I adopt a dog?</summary><p>Browse available dogs, send an inquiry, complete the application, and work with us through the home-walkthrough and matchmaking process.</p></details><details><summary>Can I meet a dog before adopting?</summary><p>Yes. Meetings are coordinated as part of the adoption process and are scheduled directly with the rescue.</p></details><details><summary>Why is a home walkthrough required?</summary><p>It helps us understand the environment and make sure the placement is safe and appropriate for the dog.</p></details><details><summary>Are there adoption fees?</summary><p>Yes. Applicable adoption and spay/neuter-related fees are handled as part of the adoption process.</p></details></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.faq{max-width:900px}details{padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(25,20,20,.14)}summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:21px;font-weight:800}details p{color:#5e5650;line-height:1.7;max-width:760px}</style>
